=== Threshold justification (G5) ===
0.01 as % of the median local ItemKNN NDCG@10 (random split, 73 contexts, median 0.5651): 1.77%
Assumption: each user has one relevant test item and a gain moves it from outside the top 10 into the top 10 (NDCG@10 of a hit at rank r is 1/log2(r+1)). +0.01 mean NDCG@10 then equals 1.0 (all new hits at rank 1) to 3.5 (all at rank 10) extra top-10 hits per 100 users.
Empirical (ItemKNN pool vs local, random split): least-squares slope through 0 of delta Recall@10 on delta NDCG@10 = 1.15, i.e. +0.01 NDCG@10 ~ 1.15 extra percentage points of Recall@10 (~ extra hits per 100 single-item users).

